     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html\">II: InstanceIdentifier (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier\">Identifier</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.extension\">II.extension</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.value\">Identifier.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Lorsque II.extension est présent, il alimente directement Identifier.value.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.root\">II.root</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.system\">Identifier.system</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>II.root alimente Identifier.system après transformation en URI, par exemple sous la forme urn:oid:[II.root] ou urn:uuid:[II.root].</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"opacity: 0.5\">\"</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.value\">Identifier.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>En l’absence de II.extension, Identifier.value peut être dérivé de II.root, notamment lorsqu’il porte directement l’identifiant.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.assigningAuthorityName\">II.assigningAuthorityName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.assigner\">Identifier.assigner</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>II.assigningAuthorityName permet de renseigner l’organisme ayant attribué l’identifiant dans Identifier.assigner.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.displayable\">II.displayable</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.extension\">Identifier.extension</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur II.displayable peut être conservée dans une extension FHIR spécifique portée par Identifier.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html\">II: InstanceIdentifier (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html#Reference\">Reference</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.assigningAuthorityName\">II.assigningAuthorityName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html#Reference#s-Reference.display\">Reference.display</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le nom de l’autorité d’attribution CDA alimente Reference.display dans la référence Identifier.assigner.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaIIToIdentifierConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html\">II: InstanceIdentifier (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier\">Identifier</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.extension\">II.extension</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier#s-Identifier.value\">Identifier.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Lorsque II.extension est présent, il alimente directement Identifier.value.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-II.html#s-II.root\">II.root</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-conce